<section class="testimonials band" id="testimonials">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">A few kind words</p>
    <h2>Testimonials &amp;<br /><em>recommendations.</em></h2>
    <p class="testimonials-intro">A mix of LinkedIn recommendations and archived recommendation letters from people I've worked with, managed, and supported across agency, nonprofit, and SaaS environments.</p>

