          <p class="testimonial-quote">“{item.quote}”</p>
          <footer><strong>{item.name}</strong><span>{item.title}</span></footer>
        </blockquote>)}
      </div>
      <p class="testimonial-note">These are excerpts from archived letters. The original letters can be shared directly when a fuller reference is useful.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
